  [Music]  peasants and uncountable peruvians  continued  living as slaves  all adults could express their votes  thanks to the popular vote  and this time a government for the  people  has um is here  to to rule  for the people and by the people  a person who like many of the peruvians  is from the suppressed classes  it's the first time that a popular party  formed in the interior of the country  uh are here democratically  that i am also a country a son of this  country  and due to the sweat of my ancestors i'm  here  and due to the opportunity my parents  gave me  i too loved  [Music]  who studied in a school in the  countryside  and today i am here in order  this history  i want you to know that you have my word  i will not defraud you i  and we will not afford you  political lines is the  fight against the pandemic of kobe 19  maintain health and life our first  challenge is to fight the covert 19  which is hitting our country hard  and i don't want to forget on this  occasion  all the many peruvians who are no longer  with us  we  this would be a priority  the virus is not finished  but  peruvians first  ensure that all of the people are  vaccinated in the  in as little time as possible  in our country will be something  fundamental  a fundamental right which the government  will  which will be decentralized  we will  are created so that no family in peru  will not have um medical  [Applause]  in order to achieve that all of the  peruvians have helped  have this health service  we have to work throughout all levels of  the government  [Music]  for this i call on the regional  government leaders to  indicate where these hospitals will be  built  and we will start furthermore with the  construction  of the hospital in san juan  we have to end the century the  centralizing of these  people having to come to lima for  medical  treatment  it will be run by the men and women who  have castile  addressing congress having been sworn in  he started by thanking his fel